    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Gabi Hartmann, a Parisian artist born in 1991, has made her mark with a style that blends pop, folk, jazz, soul and world music. As a multilingual singer, she blurs musical boundaries and conveys her emotions through a soft, melancholic voice. Following a critically acclaimed self-titled debut album in 2023, which garnered over 20 million listens and 15,000 physical sales, she has performed at prestigious festivals such as the Montreal Jazz Festival, Jazz à Vienne, and Les Francofolies. With this..."
      }
